    <title>Gromacs CH4 Box Simulation</title>
    <url>/2025/09/12/Gromacs_CH4_Box_Simulation/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>这里的内容主要是记录如何使用Gromacs进行水盒子的模拟。</p>
<p>Gromacs的输入文件为.gro, .top, .mdp。</p>
<h1 id="获取单个分子的几何文件-gro-拓扑文件-top"><a href="#获取单个分子的几何文件-gro-拓扑文件-top" class="headerlink" title="获取单个分子的几何文件.gro, 拓扑文件.top"></a>获取单个分子的几何文件.gro, 拓扑文件.top</h1><p>使用gaussview绘制CH4分子,</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">%chk=ch4.chk</span><br><span class="line"># B3LYP/def2SVP em=GD3BJ opt</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ch4.gjf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">0 1</span><br><span class="line"> C                 -1.82203704   -1.95200030   -0.87365150</span><br><span class="line"> H                 -1.46538262   -2.96081030   -0.87365150</span><br><span class="line"> H                 -1.46536420   -1.44760211    0.00000000</span><br><span class="line"> H                 -1.46536420   -1.44760211   -1.74730301</span><br><span class="line"> H                 -2.89203704   -1.95198712   -0.87365150</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>读取上一步的.chk文件做RESP计算，获取原子电荷</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">%oldchk=ch4.chk</span><br><span class="line">%chk=ch4-dot.chk</span><br><span class="line"># B3LYP/def2TZVP em=GD3BJ pop=MK IOp(6/33=2,6/42=6) geom=check guess=read</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot.gjf</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">0 1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>获取原子电荷和.mol2结构文件</p>
<p>将ch4.gjf计算输出的.chk用formchek得到.fchk。.log文件另存为.mol2文件。</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># ch4-dot.gjf</span><br><span class="line"># Created by GaussView 6.0.16</span><br><span class="line"># ch4-dot.mol2</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#</span><br><span class="line">#</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">@&lt;TRIPOS&gt;MOLECULE</span><br><span class="line">Molecule Name</span><br><span class="line">5 4</span><br><span class="line">SMALL</span><br><span class="line">NO_CHARGES</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">@&lt;TRIPOS&gt;ATOM</span><br><span class="line">1 C1    -0.0000     0.0000     0.0000 C</span><br><span class="line">2 H2     0.6347     0.6347     0.6347 H</span><br><span class="line">3 H3    -0.6347    -0.6347     0.6347 H</span><br><span class="line">4 H4    -0.6347     0.6347    -0.6347 H</span><br><span class="line">5 H5     0.6347    -0.6347    -0.6347 H</span><br><span class="line">@&lt;TRIPOS&gt;BOND</span><br><span class="line">1 1 2 1</span><br><span class="line">2 1 3 1</span><br><span class="line">3 1 4 1</span><br><span class="line">4 1 5 1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>使用Multiwfn计算RESP电荷，输出的是.chg</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">Multiwfn ./ch4-dot.fchk  </span><br><span class="line">7 </span><br><span class="line">18 </span><br><span class="line">1  </span><br><span class="line">y </span><br><span class="line">0 </span><br><span class="line">0</span><br><span class="line">q</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>输出ch4-dot.chg</p>
<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">C     0.000000    0.000000    0.000000  -0.4449850568</span><br><span class="line">H     0.634724    0.634724    0.634724   0.1112462642</span><br><span class="line">H    -0.634724   -0.634724    0.634724   0.1112462642</span><br><span class="line">H    -0.634724    0.634724   -0.634724   0.1112462642</span><br><span class="line">H     0.634724   -0.634724   -0.634724   0.1112462642</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>使用sobtop生成.gro, .ipt, .top<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sobtop ./ch4-dot.mol2</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>生成ch4-dot.gro, ch4-dot.ipt, ch4-dot.top</p>
<p>ch4-dot.gro<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ch4-dot</span><br><span class="line">     5</span><br><span class="line">    1MOL     C1    1   0.000   0.000   0.000</span><br><span class="line">    1MOL     H2    2   0.063   0.063   0.063</span><br><span class="line">    1MOL     H3    3  -0.063  -0.063   0.063</span><br><span class="line">    1MOL     H4    4  -0.063   0.063  -0.063</span><br><span class="line">    1MOL     H5    5   0.063  -0.063  -0.063</span><br><span class="line">   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<p>ch4-dot.ipt<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">; Created by Sobtop (http://sobereva.com/soft/sobtop) Version 1.0(dev5) on 2025-09-12</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ atomtypes ]</span><br><span class="line">; name   at.num      mass       charge   ptype     sigma (nm)    epsilon (kJ/mol)</span><br><span class="line">c3           6    12.010736    0.000000    A      3.399670E-01    4.577296E-01</span><br><span class="line">hc           1     1.007941    0.000000    A      2.649533E-01    6.568880E-02</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ moleculetype ]</span><br><span class="line">; name          nrexcl</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot       3</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ atoms ]</span><br><span class="line">;  Index   type   residue  resname   atom        cgnr     charge       mass</span><br><span class="line">     1     c3         1      MOL     C1            1    0.00000000   12.010736</span><br><span class="line">     2     hc         1      MOL     H2            2    0.00000000    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     3     hc         1      MOL     H3            3    0.00000000    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     4     hc         1      MOL     H4            4    0.00000000    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     5     hc         1      MOL     H5            5    0.00000000    1.007941</span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line">[ bonds ]</span><br><span class="line">; atom_i  atom_j  functype      r0 (nm)    k (kJ/mol/nm^2)</span><br><span class="line">    1       2         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H2, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       3         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H3, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       4         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H4, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       5         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H5, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line">[ angles ]</span><br><span class="line">; atom_i  atom_j  atom_k  functype    a0 (Deg.)  k (kJ/mol/rad^2)</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       3         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H3, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       4         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H4, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    3       1       4         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H3-C1-H4, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    3       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H3-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    4       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H4-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">; No pair needs to generate</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">; No improper needs to generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<p>ch4-dot.top<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">; Created by Sobtop (http://sobereva.com/soft/sobtop) Version 1.0(dev5) on 2025-09-12</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ defaults ]</span><br><span class="line">; nbfunc        comb-rule       gen-pairs       fudgeLJ    fudgeQQ</span><br><span class="line">     1              2              yes            0.5       0.8333</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#include &quot;ch4-dot.itp&quot;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ system ]</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ molecules ]</span><br><span class="line">; Molecule      nmols</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot     1</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<p>将ch4-dot.itp 中[atoms] 的charge项中的值换成ch4-dot.chg的值。</p>
<p>新的ch4-dot.itp<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">; Created by Sobtop (http://sobereva.com/soft/sobtop) Version 1.0(dev5) on 2025-09-12</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ atomtypes ]</span><br><span class="line">; name   at.num      mass       charge   ptype     sigma (nm)    epsilon (kJ/mol)</span><br><span class="line">c3           6    12.010736    0.000000    A      3.399670E-01    4.577296E-01</span><br><span class="line">hc           1     1.007941    0.000000    A      2.649533E-01    6.568880E-02</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ moleculetype ]</span><br><span class="line">; name          nrexcl</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot       3</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ atoms ]</span><br><span class="line">;  Index   type   residue  resname   atom        cgnr     charge       mass</span><br><span class="line">     1     c3         1      MOL     C1            1 -0.4449850568   12.010736</span><br><span class="line">     2     hc         1      MOL     H2            2  0.1112462642    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     3     hc         1      MOL     H3            3  0.1112462642    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     4     hc         1      MOL     H4            4  0.1112462642    1.007941</span><br><span class="line">     5     hc         1      MOL     H5            5  0.1112462642    1.007941</span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line">[ bonds ]</span><br><span class="line">; atom_i  atom_j  functype      r0 (nm)    k (kJ/mol/nm^2)</span><br><span class="line">    1       2         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H2, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       3         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H3, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       4         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H4, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    1       5         1        0.109690     2.766461E+05     ; C1-H5, prebuilt c3-hc</span><br><span class="line"> </span><br><span class="line">[ angles ]</span><br><span class="line">; atom_i  atom_j  atom_k  functype    a0 (Deg.)  k (kJ/mol/rad^2)</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       3         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H3, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       4         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H4, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    2       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H2-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    3       1       4         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H3-C1-H4, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    3       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H3-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line">    4       1       5         1       107.580      3.296992E+02     ; H4-C1-H5, prebuilt hc-c3-hc</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">; No pair needs to generate</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">; No improper needs to generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<h1 id="构建盒子"><a href="#构建盒子" class="headerlink" title="构建盒子"></a>构建盒子</h1><p>先生成一个带一个CH4分子的盒子<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gmx editconf -f ch4-dot.gro -o ch4-box.gro -bt cubic -box 2.3</span><br><span class="line"># -f 分子的结构文件 -o 盒子的结构文件 -bt 盒子类型 -box  盒子尺寸</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<p>往盒子里插入分子<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gmx insert-molecules -f ch4-box.gro -o ch4-box.gro -ci ch4-dot.gro -nmol 299 -try 10000</span><br><span class="line">-f 旧盒子 -o 新盒子 -ci 插入的分子 -nmol 插入分子数 -try 尝试插入的最大次数</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<p>修改 ch4-dot.top, 将 [molecules] 中的的nmols 改成盒子里分子的数量<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">; Created by Sobtop (http://sobereva.com/soft/sobtop) Version 1.0(dev5) on 2025-09-12</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ defaults ]</span><br><span class="line">; nbfunc        comb-rule       gen-pairs       fudgeLJ    fudgeQQ</span><br><span class="line">     1              2              yes            0.5       0.8333</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">#include &quot;ch4-dot.itp&quot;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ system ]</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">[ molecules ]</span><br><span class="line">; Molecule      nmols</span><br><span class="line">ch4-dot     300</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
<h1 id="编写-mdp文件"><a href="#编写-mdp文件" class="headerlink" title="编写.mdp文件"></a>编写.mdp文件</h1><p>能量最小化<br>min.mdp<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">;define                   = -DFLEXIBLE</span><br><span class="line">integrator               = steep</span><br><span class="line">nsteps                   = 1000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">nstenergy                = 500</span><br><span class="line">nstlog                   = 500</span><br><span class="line">nstxout-compressed       = 1000</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">constraint-algorithm     = lincs</span><br><span class="line">constraints              = h-bonds</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cutoff-scheme            = Verlet</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">coulombtype              = PME</span><br><span class="line">rcoulomb                 = 1.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">vdwtype                  = Cut-off</span><br><span class="line">rvdw                     = 1.0</span><br><span class="line">DispCorr                 = EnerPres</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">gmx grompp -f min.mdp -o ch4-box-min.tpr -c ch4-box.gro -p ch4-dot.top</span><br><span class="line">gmx mdrun -v -deffnm ch4-box-min</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
]]></content>
